  "meta": {
    "about": "VectorCraft only. A hand-written SVG plum badge becomes a sheet of sticker variants: a print-shop halftone, a wobbly hand-drawn version, a bulging 'warp' version, a 3D extruded coin, and a two-colour risograph recolour. Each is exported as SVG and PNG; the palette of the original comes out as JSON.",
